{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「香港網球一哥」黃澤林月初宣告與前女友康堤結束半年戀愛關係，本月25日即被拍攝到與「籃球一姐」譚旻萱於廣州球場 …</p><p></p>\n<p>「香港網球一哥」黃澤林月初宣告與前女友康堤結束半年戀愛關係，本月25日即被拍攝到與「籃球一姐」譚旻萱於廣州球場旁親密相擁。這段相隔時間極短新關係不僅引發網民質疑無縫接軌，更有排球員發文暗示自己慘遭背叛。錯綜複雜多角關係時間線隨著網民翻查社交平台互動逐一曝光。\n</p>\n<h2>網民翻查點讚紀錄揭露康堤情傷跡象</h2>\n<p>網民仔細翻查眾人Instagram點讚紀錄，發現譚旻萱曾於10月15日對康堤慶祝22歲巴黎生日帖文按下讚好，相隔大約10天後即被發現與黃澤林同遊廣州。追溯至9月13日，康堤最後一次對譚旻萱公布搬遷新居帖文讚好，其後雙方再無交集。康堤與黃澤林於9月上旬仍與朋友一同光顧壽司店，直到9月中旬後二人互相取消追蹤，當時已流傳分手消息。早前康堤現身公開場合時面容憔悴，身上散發著難以掩飾情傷。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316017398914362_3984422726ae173ee4fc87.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"vM-vFZeflNcxNb34QhxiFWc4dTDy0UydCffUUQn31FE.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316017398914362_3984422726ae173ee4fc87.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>Mandy曾讚好康堤於10月15日分享在巴黎度過22歲生日的帖文。（圖片來源：(ig@_constancec_)）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179294195919821449_1318604176ade1f87bf835.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-25 下午11.04.42.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179294195919821449_1318604176ade1f87bf835.png\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>網民翻查社交平台互動紀錄，指黃澤林早於9月10日便開始點讚女方帖文。（圖片來源：IG圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179202784274867715_178321706ad02cc321974.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳康堤 黃澤林 康堤上月被發現只有follow粉絲開設的專頁，而沒有黃澤林個人IG賬號。（圖片來源：IG@_constancec_）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179202784274867715_178321706ad02cc321974.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>康堤上月被發現只有follow粉絲開設的專頁，而沒有黃澤林個人IG賬號。（圖片來源：IG@_constancec_）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>譚旻萱社交帳號遭洗版引發兩極評價</h2>\n<p>緋聞傳出後，譚旻萱社交帳號瞬間湧入大批網民留言洗版。部分人士抨擊她疑似插足他人感情，並留言狠批其行為；另一派網民則發聲支持黃澤林迎接新戀情。儘管網上點讚紀錄、街頭照片及各方言論均無法確切證實當中有否存在第三者或「無縫換畫」情況，惟此次事件已於網絡世界觸發激烈陣營對立。</p>\n<h2>譚旻萱現身廣州與黃澤林親密互攬</h2>\n<p>有民眾於本月25日目擊譚旻萱現身廣州，與黃澤林結伴吃早餐及觀賞賽事。二人在球場旁邊舉止親暱，更被捕捉到相擁畫面，讓新戀情浮出水面。基於黃澤林於本月初剛坦承結束為期半年戀愛關係，這段時間差極短新發展隨即惹來各界注視。群眾比對二人近期行蹤，紛紛質疑當中是否牽涉無縫接軌。\n</p>\n<h2>區顯揚發文暗示遭背叛引爆派帽疑雲</h2>\n<p>排球員區顯揚無預警於社交網站發布限時動態，內容疑似暗指自己慘遭譚旻萱背叛。帖文內弦外之音引起廣泛討論，讓這場風波衍生出另一受害者，迅速躍升為網上熱門話題。雖然雙方暫未對緋聞作出正式官方聲明，但牽涉多位體壇健將與星二代複雜關係，已經驅使大批粉絲湧入當事人社交帳號尋找蛛絲馬跡。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179067539353731818_8243082886abb89c1e8af8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳康堤 黃澤林 陳康堤每次都愛得高調，今次與黃澤林的戀情更獲母親徐濠縈認可，徐濠縈私下稱呼他為「黃Sir」，而黃澤林則稱呼她為「Auntie」，早前陳氏一家三口都有在社交媒體祝賀Coleman的好成績，到今次亞運已再無互動。（圖片來源：IG@_constancec_）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179067539353731818_8243082886abb89c1e8af8.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>陳康堤每次都愛得高調，今次與黃澤林的戀情更獲母親徐濠縈認可，徐濠縈私下稱呼他為「黃Sir」，而黃澤林則稱呼她為「Auntie」，早前陳氏一家三口都有在社交媒體祝賀Coleman的好成績，到今次亞運已再無互動。（圖片來源：IG@_constancec_）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179294196506533005_5251584346ade1f8d7acfa.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179294196506533005_5251584346ade1f8d7acfa.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>網民猜測即係兩個都無縫接軌？（圖片來源：黃澤林IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179292968085091343_17621832696addef91398f4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"黃澤林 康堤 （圖片來源：threads）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179292968085091343_17621832696addef91398f4.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>譚旻萱火速撻着黃澤林！（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307130678418468_13062066686ae018cb37089.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"qST3rKvF3piR_LJMvrvo51T3KOHYsOcWZgYKR2YGCkc.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307130678418468_13062066686ae018cb37089.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>Mandy與身兼排球教練及餐廳老闆區顯揚低調相戀（圖片來源：IG@austinauhinyeung）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%ba%b7%e5%a0%a4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">康堤</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%ad%9a%e6%97%bb%e8%90%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">譚旻萱</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%bb%83%e6%be%a4%e6%9e%97/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">黃澤林</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3531368\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 28 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T05:22:44.851802+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1557,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T04:03:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T05:18:40.990284+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T05:18:40.990284+00:00","content_hash":"e9d7b0aaa5acac53eb9437b34cc785da19c9f94233749e9c275e11c47d5a5c92","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}